<doctext field_name="doctext">&lt;p&gt;I mean this: &lt;c&gt;if (defined $err)&lt;/c&gt; can become &lt;c&gt;if (defined($err) &amp;&amp; ($err eq 'YouveGotError'))&lt;/c&gt;, so that it errors only on'YouveGotError' blessed refs and nothing else, because the sub may normally return other blessed things.&lt;/p&gt;</doctext>
